{"summary": "In this room, five charcoal gray ergonomic reading chairs, each made with soft, breathable mesh fabric and sleek contours for comfort, are paired with five brushed silver adjustable reading lamps, made with lightweight aluminum and featuring dimmable LED bulbs, positioned 0.5 meters away and mounted on their sides. A matte black digital book display, made with frameless tempered glass, is placed on top of a glossy white interactive touchscreen table, made with reinforced glass and edge-lit with ambient LEDs, while a translucent white holographic encyclopedia projector, made with polycarbonate and emitting a soft blue glow, is suspended 1 meter above it. Three muted beige soundproof study pods, made with acoustic foam panels and cylindrical with sliding glass doors, are positioned 2 meters away from a lush green biophilic plant wall, made with preserved moss and ferns in a vertical grid pattern, which is mounted on the wall opposite the digital book display. Two deep navy modular lounge sofas, made with plush velvet upholstery and low-profile geometric segments, are arranged in a semicircle around the interactive touchscreen table, with five warm amber ambient floor lights, made with frosted acrylic and pillar-shaped, placed 1 meter away from the sofas and study pods to emit a soft, diffused glow."}
